      ordering (`declared_at` newer than the stored `declared_head_at`; NULL either side = refuse):
      a conductor that has not yet integrated a newer canonical link answers with the OLD canonical
      record — canonical, yet stale — and an unconditional Declare stamp moved the head BACKWARDS
